                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "J. When possible, teachers who have been identified as involuntary transferees will be transferred to a comparable position, provided they are qualified to meet the identified instructional needs of the school.",
            "block_bbox": [
                154,
                1025,
                986,
