        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "34-7-1 All involuntary transferees and unassigned leave returnees will be placed by the end of April. Said involuntaries and unassigned leave returnees will be placed into open, ongoing positions for which they are qualified, if available. Said teachers will only be placed into one (1) year positions if no open, ongoing positions exist for which they are qualified.",
